    "long_instructions": "## Wireframing Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this chatbot to plan your app layout before drawing.\r\n\r\nIt can help you:\r\n- decide what elements your app needs (buttons, inputs, displays)\r\n- identify where users will interact with your app\r\n- think through what your app should show in response\r\n\r\nUse your ideas from planning.md to guide your design.",
